{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/Cinematic_Gif.gif?t=1744494451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Malevolent Madness</i> invites players into a tension-filled horror adventure, offering an experience rich in mystery and puzzles. A mysterious time machine unleashes extraordinary powers that could disrupt the balance between universes, but this discovery becomes a significant threat to humanity in the wrong hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players guide a scientist with special abilities assigned to secret projects. Hidden in a dark cave, a time machine, which can only be activated by a specific DNA, initially shows no response but suddenly starts to function unexpectedly. This machine poses a risk of annihilating the universes if the same matter exists in both. As our character uncovers the terrifying secrets behind the machine, they decide to quit their job, yet a malevolent professor wishes to use the machine for his own purposes and abducts the character, subjecting them to torturous tests. The horrifying events grow increasingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Tension and Mystery</strong>: Explore in a dark atmosphere filled with lurking dangers at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Artificial Intelligence</strong>: Face enemies and cleverly designed puzzles that force you to hide and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging Visual and Audio Design</strong>: Experience fear deeply with top-notch graphics and quality sound design at every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parkour and Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Utilize your skills to progress and remain alert at all times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/Gif2Low.gif?t=1744494451\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First of many\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/c1b8457e876adad480b9324016b72cdc556c28de.jpg"},{"name":"Half way there\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/132a6de47602ce190da9d42b91a3aab15ad3d61b.jpg"},{"name":"End of the road\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/c775b9b9bd742845d615579ff70e8fadc50a86ba.jpg"},{"name":"Just a dream?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/4a11d2298e3e49905dbb35cbe2c63fe62f25a853.jpg"},{"name":"Too dark to be\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/3f8b2c0c0221454bb9821a5fa82add3f8e536991.jpg"},{"name":"Must be seen\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/f9899592ecbbf421f06ff7a7cb99c20091407121.jpg"},{"name":"Not so hot right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/5764103f82c1e6985ee35fb63d1ba52a33448d70.jpg"},{"name":"Way down we go\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/2d9fbf471c9cee6ab942f78e751d1d2d34d5b490.jpg"},{"name":"Best companion EVER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/431b3878726f78fe85ae690c130e8e18d9dd6b9d.jpg"},{"name":"Travel The World And The Seven Seas\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290550/61f6c58758c8e35146a92e09b0b15613057c0c9f.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290550?t=1744494451","backgro